OL,3,GNEWSAQuake villager thought 'ironing
OL,4,Aboard had fallen over'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA small Lancashire village has
OL,7,Fexperienced its fourth earthquake
OL,8,Fwithin six months.
OL,10,FThe British Geological Survey (BGS)
OL,11,Fsaid the 2.7 magnitude tremor was felt
OL,12,Fin Silverdale, Lancaster, at 09:38 BST.
OL,14,FSarah, who lives in the village, said
OL,15,Fshe thought her "ironing board had
OL,16,Ffallen over in the airing cupboard"
OL,17,Fwhen she felt the vibrations.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
