OL,3,GNEWSAQuake villager thought 'ironing
OL,4,Aboard had fallen over'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCallum Harrison, from the BGS, said
OL,7,Fthere had been 28 recorded tremors
OL,8,Fcentred on the Silverdale area since a
OL,9,F3.2 magnitude earthquake in December.
OL,10,FMost of them, he said, had been too
OL,11,Fsmall to feel.
